// The words every app's buttons and alerts share, so apps say them alike: name one
// in a .uix with <String name="ok" table="100" index="1"/>. Tables 100 and up are
// VentureOS's shared ones; an app numbers its own below 100.
1 ^OK^
2 ^Cancel^
3 ^Save^
4 ^Don't Save^
5 ^Open^
6 ^Close^
7 ^Delete^
